      "role": "user",
      "content": "okay that makes sense. so if i use it for work i can deduct it. but what if i use it for work most of the time but also occasionally for gaming or just regular stuff around the house? like is there a specific way i should split the cost or do i just pick one? also i feel like i always lose track of these smaller receipts, it's kind of a headache trying to find where all the money went.",
